  "abstract": "Covers the two in-toto specifications: the in-toto Attestation Framework (Statement, ResourceDescriptor, DigestSet, DSSE Envelope, Bundle, parsing rules, the vetted predicate catalog and the validation model) and the in-toto specification for supply chain layouts, steps, inspections, artifact rules, link metadata, sublayouts and final product verification. Each is its own family: Attestation Framework v1.2 (v1.2.0) is current and v0.1 legacy; the in-toto specification v1.0 (1.0.0) is current and v0.9 legacy; the draft ITE-10 and ITE-11 layout extensions are tracked as previews. DSSE v1.0.2 is pinned as a dependency. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, the Statement and Envelope, predicates, layouts and links, and verification.",
